  "$comment": "Single source of truth for Fullmoon i3. Generators emit Tokens.java (mod) and tokens.css (launcher). Never write a colour literal anywhere else; design/verify-tokens.mjs fails the build if you do. A colour is either an oklch triple or an sRGB hex; an optional alpha makes it a translucent ground (the game composites it over its own blur). \"game\": false keeps a token out of Tokens.java — the launcher still reads it from tokens.css until its own redesign lands.",
