  "color": {
    "$comment": "Moon Glass: one dark glass ground over the game's own blur, and only ink, icons and figures on it. Grounds are translucent by design — hover is a 5% lift of white, selection a 10% wash of gold, a divider 8% white — so every ground reads as the same pane of glass under different light. Gold is used for one thing per surface (the selection or the primary action) and never for a frame. Ornament tokens stay for the launcher only.",
